WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:14.576
was late at night.

2
00:00:18.477 --> 00:00:20.357
Gildong was in his room, reading.

3
00:00:22.598 --> 00:00:25.039
Suddenly he heard the flutter of a bird.

4
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:29.040
A crow landed just outside the doors.

5
00:00:30.472 --> 00:00:31.693
Caw! Caw!

6
00:00:31.953 --> 00:00:34.794
Caw! The crow flew away.

7
00:00:34.814 --> 00:00:39.516
"That's odd," Gildong said to himself.

8
00:00:39.536 --> 00:00:42.177
"Crows don't usually cry at night.

9
00:00:43.378 --> 00:00:45.279
Maybe it's trying to tell me something."

10
00:00:46.659 --> 00:00:48.320
Shivers went down his spine.

11
00:00:50.861 --> 00:00:52.602
Gildong had a bad feeling.

12
00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:56.464
He saw his fan nearby and reached for it.

13
00:01:01.036 --> 00:01:02.778
Teukjae peered at the room.

14
00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.862
Gildong was reading in front of a candle.

15
00:01:06.882 --> 00:01:11.386
"This will be easy," Teukjae thought.

16
00:01:12.768 --> 00:01:15.090
Silently he leaped into the room.

17
00:01:17.252 --> 00:01:19.695
But when he landed, Gildong was gone!

18
00:01:21.196 --> 00:01:24.660
Before he could look for the boy, the room began to shake.

19
00:01:30.148 --> 00:01:32.889
Teukjae found himself in a dark forest.

20
00:01:36.771 --> 00:01:38.712
must be magic," Teukjae thought.

21
00:01:38.732 --> 00:01:41.713
"I didn't know this boy was so powerful.

22
00:01:42.854 --> 00:01:45.455
Luckily he cannot match my skills or strength."

23
00:01:47.636 --> 00:01:50.417
The sound of a flute floated through the forest.

24
00:01:51.217 --> 00:01:54.118
Teukjae heard the crunch of footsteps behind him.

25
00:01:55.279 --> 00:01:57.580
He spun around, but no one was there.

26
00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.302
When he turned back, he saw Gildong.

27
00:02:03.883 --> 00:02:07.165
The boy was playing a flute and riding a donkey.

28
00:02:07.185 --> 00:02:12.268
"Surrender now, and I'll let you go," Gildong said.

29
00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:17.312
Teukjae laughed.

30
00:02:18.312 --> 00:02:20.194
"No one has ever fought me and lived.

31
00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.195
And you're just a child!

32
00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:24.276
You'll never escape from me."

33
00:02:24.296 --> 00:02:29.460
"Don't say I didn't warn you," Gildong said.

34
00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.821
Teukjae reached for his daggers.

35
00:02:35.002 --> 00:02:36.383
He threw them at Gildong.

36
00:02:38.385 --> 00:02:41.727
Gildong jumped into the air and unfolded his fan.

37
00:02:41.747 --> 00:02:45.790
"Vortex!" Whoosh!

38
00:02:46.331 --> 00:02:48.873
A strong wind blew the daggers away.

39
00:02:51.915 --> 00:02:54.397
Then the daggers changed direction.

40
00:02:56.658 --> 00:03:01.620
They were heading straight toward Teukjae.

41
00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:05.642
Teukjae jumped away, but the ground wasn't there.

42
00:03:07.703 --> 00:03:09.944
He was falling fast in the darkness.

43
00:03:09.964 --> 00:03:12.425
"I surrender!"

44
00:03:12.685 --> 00:03:13.585
Teukjae cried.

45
00:03:13.605 --> 00:03:16.406
"Why did you come for me?"

46
00:03:16.647 --> 00:03:18.567
Gildong's voice boomed around him.

47
00:03:18.587 --> 00:03:20.708
"Lady Yoo sent me.

48
00:03:21.869 --> 00:03:23.109
Now will you let me go?"

49
00:03:23.489 --> 00:03:24.290
Teukjae said.

50
00:03:26.131 --> 00:03:29.192
Bam! Teukjae crashed down onto the floor.

51
00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:31.701
He was in the boy's room again.

52
00:03:32.741 --> 00:03:34.542
Everything had been an illusion.

53
00:03:36.143 --> 00:03:38.104
Gildong stood over Teukjae.

54
00:03:40.985 --> 00:03:41.925
"I will let you go.

55
00:03:42.866 --> 00:03:45.627
But you must never harm anyone ever again.

56
00:03:46.427 --> 00:03:47.688
I'll come for you if you do."

57
00:03:49.048 --> 00:03:51.830
Teukjae nodded and ran out of the room.

58
00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:56.932
Gildong watched the man disappear into the darkness.

59
00:03:59.176 --> 00:04:01.821
"I knew Lady Yoo hated me," Gildong thought.

60
00:04:01.841 --> 00:04:04.847
"But I didn't think she'd send someone to kill me."

61
00:04:05.568 --> 00:04:06.530
He bit his lip.

62
00:04:07.652 --> 00:04:09.395
"Lady Yoo will try to get rid of me again.

63
00:04:10.677 --> 00:04:11.899
There's only one thing to do."
